{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788343298000-5427be", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "给我一份试用期转正评估表的模板框架，包含自评和主管评分两部分。", "id": "23a9df081e2c449482220e5b71793b5f", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:01:38", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "49a2353766e04ab3b5ac735b70153ec9", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:01:38", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "a73bcf4a4d064f7d9db82b1bef67348d", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:01:46", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:02:18"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**试用期转正评估表**（框架）\n\n一、员工信息：姓名 / 部门 / 岗位 / 入职日期 / 评估期\n二、员工自评（30%）\n  1. 岗位职责完成情况\n  2. 学习与适应能力\n  3. 团队协作\n三、主管评分（50%）\n  1. 工作质量与效率\n  2. 制度遵守\n  3. 改进建议落实\n四、人事意见（20%）：考勤记录 / 培训完成度\n五、结论：□ 提前转正 □ 按期转正 □ 延长试用 □ 不予转正", "id": "dbc29410a1fc45e0a7f2ac05776f30ed", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:01:46", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:02:18"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "b75efc1a783341e6a558c52de512f4ca", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:01:46", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:02:18", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "延长试用期最长可以延多久？", "id": "750b3b88ad244aa4b335b0c23a70c136", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:07:38", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "0f2709ccadaf449e89f289371a4a45d6", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:07:38", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "98179d9b7b0c4c3783f3452adab93fa3", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:07:46", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:08:18"}, {"type": "text", "text": "按《劳动合同法》规定，**同一用人单位与同一劳动者只能约定一次试用期**，且总时长受合同期限约束（三年期合同最长 6 个月）。\n实操建议：如需延长，必须在原试用期内提出并签署书面变更协议，不能在试用期满后再补。", "id": "589fbac525754138b82da2360a1648d3", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:07:46", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:08:18"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "23007499db42490cb47f634c111e7e20", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:07:46", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:08:18", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "评估表打分权重可以调整吗？", "id": "ebc8dba1057d49778dd2039010b18857", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:10:18", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "e1d502e5a6ab40509adb4bc6d623924f", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:10:18", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "d731809bd7454ab5801b8797c915c09a", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:10:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:11:03"}, {"type": "text", "text": "可以微调：自评 20%–30%、主管 50%–60% 区间内都合理，关键是不让自评占比过高；研发类岗位可加「跨部门评分」10%，由协作部门打分。", "id": "ddc71dfa7b5344818c5b906a4432f283", "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:10:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:11:03"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "5fb75baacc6a469abf49a5f49d8a6f39", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:10:24", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T10:11:03", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}